{"file_name": "\u0645\u0634\u0631\u0648\u0639 \u062c\u062f\u064a\u062f (7).png", "id": "642462347959839", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75422394_642462351293172_770772060691426654_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f1asLONX1Z8Q7kNvwHXr4_H&_nc_oc=AdqIFlKiK_LAz8momOvGwTsS44FPxC5X3nXPs91YOcvR_M7BekcRLgahtygKRWLib40&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRtjFmzW1l7LphkK7dZzYB9x9NwzlDlafczSacbiTw0xA&oe=6B09CFD8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Burj Alluqluq", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Dive into a virtual exploration of one of Jerusalem's most significant historical landmarks with the \"Burj Al-Luqluq VR\" app. This immersive virtual reality experience transports you directly into the heart of Burj Al-Luqluq, allowing you to wander through its ancient architecture and uncover the layers of history that have shaped this iconic site. Through a carefully curated interactive tour, users can engage with the rich cultural and historical narratives of Burj Al-Luqluq, learning about its significance in Jerusalem's storied past.\n\nThe app features detailed reconstructions of the site, enriched with historical facts and stories that bring the past to life. Whether you're a history enthusiast, a cultural explorer, or simply looking for a unique virtual reality experience, \"Burj Al-Luqluq VR\" offers a captivating journey through time. Experience the beauty of Jerusalem's heritage from a new perspective, exploring the intricacies of Burj Al-Luqluq's architecture and the historical events that have unfolded within its walls.", "short_description": "Discover the depths of history and culture at Burj Al-Luqluq with our unique virtual reality app. \"Burj Al-Luqluq VR\" offers an interactive tour that takes you on a historical journey inside one of Jerusalem's most prominent landmarks, providing an immersive opportunity to explore its rich heritage and ancient stories."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/burj-alluqluq-vr", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mohammad Salah", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.burjalluqluq.org/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["ar"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7008152152637718"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569455_426961373201543_3146222373028051682_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YZu9Fu9IO2YQ7kNvwEk6Z9-&_nc_oc=AdqNPULeQ9bafakTdnLJgkkkVvAxFugbgnNo2ij-ASBKYpvKizlY7q5A_wQTz0hDFho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT31oM3-EV7ZlbCCe845O4HV8qvfTdRp-p2HeXfkb6UcA&oe=6B09C1F1"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Burj Alluqluq", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Travel & Exploration", "id": "726368587961803"}], "release_date": 1709751780, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "6965205536932380", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "6965205480265719", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ad